{"id":"e34378cc764bec7c","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-sequential-principles.md","title":"Monotone Convergence and Bolzano-Weierstrass","display":"df-sequential-principles — Monotone Convergence and Bolzano-Weierstrass","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-sequential-principles","aliases":["62-df-sequential-principles"],"display":"df-sequential-principles — Monotone Convergence and Bolzano-Weierstrass","depends_on":["[[62-df-real-sequence]]","[[62-df-real-code]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Theorem III.2.2","source_pages":[107],"source_pdf_pages":[125]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-sequential-principles"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-sequential-principles</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sequential-principles — Monotone Convergence and Bolzano-Weierstrass"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fa4f48bc86dadb9f\" href=\"?note=fa4f48bc86dadb9f\" title=\"62-df-real-sequence\">62-df-real-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a9b9b98944ad28e8\" href=\"?note=a9b9b98944ad28e8\" title=\"62-df-real-code\">62-df-real-code</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Theorem III.2.2"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>107</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>125</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>实数列、UnitSeq、Conv、SubConv 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fa4f48bc86dadb9f\" href=\"?note=fa4f48bc86dadb9f\" title=\"62-df-real-sequence\">62-df-real-sequence</a>，实序见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a9b9b98944ad28e8\" href=\"?note=a9b9b98944ad28e8\" title=\"62-df-real-code\">62-df-real-code</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MCT}_{[0,1]}\">\\(\\mathrm{MCT}_{[0,1]}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BW}_{[0,1]}\">\\(\\mathrm{BW}_{[0,1]}\\)</span> 为下面引入的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_2\">\\(L_2\\)</span> 句子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sequential\\text{-}principles}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MCT}_{[0,1]}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall F[(\\mathsf{UnitSeq}(F)\\land\\forall n\\;F_n\\le_R F_{n+1})\\to\\exists x\\;\\mathsf{Conv}(F,x)],\\\\\n\\mathrm{BW}_{[0,1]}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall F[\\mathsf{UnitSeq}(F)\\to\\exists g\\exists x\\;\\mathsf{SubConv}(F,g,x)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sequential\\text{-}principles}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MCT}_{[0,1]}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall F[(\\mathsf{UnitSeq}(F)\\land\\forall n\\;F_n\\le_R F_{n+1})\\to\\exists x\\;\\mathsf{Conv}(F,x)],\\\\\n\\mathrm{BW}_{[0,1]}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall F[\\mathsf{UnitSeq}(F)\\to\\exists g\\exists x\\;\\mathsf{SubConv}(F,g,x)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>归一化到闭单位区间。一般有界实数列可先取一个正有理上界，对列做有理仿射变换，再变换极限；RCA₀ 可实施这些编码操作。因此归一化版本与书中一般有界版本可证等价。BW 的子序列由严格递增数值函数 g 指定；没有预设子序列极限存在。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Theorem III.2.2；纸面页 107；PDF 页 125。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-real-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"fa4f48bc86dadb9f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-real-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-real-code","status":"resolved","id":"a9b9b98944ad28e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-real-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-real-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"fa4f48bc86dadb9f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"实数列、UnitSeq、Conv、SubConv 见 [[62-df-real-sequence]]，实序见 [[62-df-real-code]]。$\\mathrm{MCT}_{[0,1]}$、$\\mathrm{BW}_{[0,1]}$ 为下面引入的 $L_2$ 句子。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-real-code","status":"resolved","id":"a9b9b98944ad28e8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"实数列、UnitSeq、Conv、SubConv 见 [[62-df-real-sequence]]，实序见 [[62-df-real-code]]。$\\mathrm{MCT}_{[0,1]}$、$\\mathrm{BW}_{[0,1]}$ 为下面引入的 $L_2$ 句子。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{MCT}_{[0,1]}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BW}_{[0,1]}","display":false},{"tex":"L_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sequential\\text{-}principles}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MCT}_{[0,1]}&\\coloneqq\\forall F[(\\mathsf{UnitSeq}(F)\\land\\forall n\\;F_n\\le_R F_{n+1})\\to\\exists x\\;\\mathsf{Conv}(F,x)],\\\\\n\\mathrm{BW}_{[0,1]}&\\coloneqq\\forall F[\\mathsf{UnitSeq}(F)\\to\\exists g\\exists x\\;\\mathsf{SubConv}(F,g,x)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1501,"backlinks":[{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-sequential-principles|Monotone Convergence and Bolzano-Weierstrass]]"},{"id":"5270559f6819fa09","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{ACA}_0$ 见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-ACA0]]；$\\mathrm{RC},\\mathrm{RS}_{[0,1]}$ 见 [[62-df-real-Cauchy-supremum]]，$\\mathrm{MCT}_{[0,1]}$ 见 [[62-df-sequential-principles]]，MCT 反演见 [[62-thm-ACA0-sequential-equivalences]]；EquivOver 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。"},{"id":"8e5c7955f4b33147","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"